OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is going on with the takeover
OL,4,Aof Northampton Town?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere have been rumbles of significant
OL,7,Fchanges for Northampton Town since
OL,8,FApril.
OL,10,FThe club, which was relegated to League
OL,11,FTwo last season, has been teasing
OL,12,Fsupporters about talks with a
OL,13,F"well-funded investment group" over a
OL,14,Fpotential deal that could clear its
OL,15,Fdebts.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
