OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is going on with the takeover
OL,4,Aof Northampton Town?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCobblers chairman Kelvin Thomas claimed
OL,7,Fin May that investment had been "pretty
OL,8,Fmuch agreed" and earlier this month
OL,9,Fdetails about the group behind the
OL,10,Fmove, Sports Alpha Capital (SAC),
OL,11,Femerged. They included news that former
OL,12,FAC Milan, Chelsea and Brazil forward
OL,13,FAlexandre Pato was involved.
OL,15,FThe wait goes on for fans, but what do
OL,16,Fwe know about the potential takeover?
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
